  "Vortex Strangle <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Phys damage to all foes, and increase all allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (For every $3 SPD, additionally increase DMG Dealt by $4, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>) for $6 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $7, has <link=\"s|220\"><u>Guaranteed Critical</u></link> to the main target.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The racing flag tears through the wind, the great earth quakes, dust and dirt swirl violently, declaring victory is determined, grinding all who block its way to nothing.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size=25>Overload Acceleration Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size=25>Overload Acceleration <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (For every $2 SPD, additionally increase ATK by $3, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>), and increase DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> (For every $6 SPD, additionally increase DEF by $7, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>) for $9 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Give all allies $10 stack of <color=#FFFC40>$11</color> Shield for $12 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Adrenaline floods every synapse, redlining into maximum velocity, the finish line swallows your vision.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Roaring Engine Lv.$1": "",
  "Roaring Engine <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Increase all allies' Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (For every $2 SPD, additionally increase Pierce by $3, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>), and increase ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> (For every $6 SPD, additionally increase ATK by $7, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>) for $9 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Increase the main target's Pierce by <color=#FFFC40>$10</color> (For every $11 SPD, additionally increase Pierce by $12, up to <color=#FFFC40>$13</color>) for $14 turn.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The finish line of victory is within grasp, engines roar, SPD soars, an unstoppable fighting spirit to annihilate all in its path.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (For every $2 SPD, additional increase ATK by $3, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>), and increase DMG Dealt by $5 (For every $6 SPD, additional increase DMG Dealt by $7, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>) for $9 turns; When the main target manually deals damage to foes, additionally decrease the foes' main target's Down Points by $10.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
