  "At the start of battle, gain $1 km/h starting [Speed]; After each ally's turn. Increase [Speed] by $2 (For every $4 SPD over $3, additionally increase [Speed] by $5 km/h, up to $6 km/h); At the start of your turn, you can use [Quantum Transmission] to convert $7 [Speed] into Extra Action Energy and gain 1 Extra Action at the end of your turn, with a $8 turn cooldown; When you reach $9, $10, $11 total accumulated [Speed] in battle, activate Level 1, Level 2, Level 3 [Rapid Wheel], increase all allies' Pierce by $12, $13, $14.": "",
