  "Escape the Lost Highway": "",
  "Quick as Lightning": "",
  "At the start of battle, increase starting [Speed] to $1 km/h; During Extra Action, you can use [Quantum Transmission] to convert $2 km/h [Speed] into Boost Energy, upgrading your next {{B}} skill effect, up to $3 Boost Energy;\\nHigh Skill Upgrade Effects (Need at least 1 Boost Energy):\\n[Vortex Strangle]: When using this skill, increase own Crit Rate by $4; If this downs a foe, increase all allies' ATK by $5 for $6 turns;\\n[Overload Acceleration]: Increase Shield by $7, extends the Shield by $8 turn;\\n[Roaring Engine]: The used during Extra Action Pierce now works on all allies.\\nUltimate Skill Upgrade Effects (Need 2 Boost Energy):\\n[Vortex Strangle]: Increase all allies' DMG Dealt to Downed foes by $9 for $10 turn;\\n[Overload Acceleration]: Decrease all allies' DMG Taken by $11 for $12 turn;\\n[Roaring Engine]: Increase all allies' DMG Bonus by $13 for $14 turn.": "",
  "Boost Energy": "",
  "Deal $1 ATK Phys damage to <color=#FFFF00>all</color> foes, and increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies' DMG Dealt by $2 (For every $3 SPD, additionally increase DMG Dealt by $4, up to $5) for $6 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Increase skill damage by $7, has Guaranteed Critical to the main target.": "",
  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Phys damage to all foes, and increase all allies' DMG Dealt by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> (For every $3 SPD, additionally increase DMG Dealt by $4, up to <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>) for $6 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Increase <link=\"s|285\"><u>Skill Damage</u></link> by $7, has <link=\"s|220\"><u>Guaranteed Critical</u></link> to the main target.": "",
  "Increase <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies ATK by $1 (For every $2 SPD, additionally increase ATK by $3, up to $4), and increase DEF by $5 (For every $6 SPD, additionally increase DEF by $7, up to $8) for $9 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Give <color=#FFFF00>all</color> allies $10 stack of $11 Shield for $12 turns.": "",
  "Increase all allies' ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> (For every $2 SPD, additionally increase ATK by $3, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>), and increase DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> (For every $6 SPD, additionally increase DEF by $7, up to <color=#FFFC40>$8</color>) for $9 turns;\\nUsed during Extra Action: Give all allies $10 stack of <color=#FFFC40>$11</color> Shield for $12 turns.": "",
