  "r:\"Deal Physical damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nAlso, increase party's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by (\\d+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\nWhen used on an extra action, increase skill damage by (\\d+)%, and activate a guaranteed critical hit on the main target\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase party's Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\nWhen used on an extra action, grant a shield to all allies equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\. This effect lasts for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\nWhen used on an extra action, also increase the main target's pierce rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turn \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, increase party's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns \\(for every (\\d+) points of Speed, increase by ([\\d.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Also, when the selected ally of this Highlight next deals direct damage to foes, decrease the selected foe's Down Points by (\\d+) more\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to (\\d+) foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When Mayumi is present, increase party's damage during extra actions by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When Mayumi is present, increase party's damage dealt to downed foes by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\. Also, when Mayumi knocks down a foe, deal more Physical damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\.\"": "",
  "At the start of battle, Mayumi gains 90 Velocity stacks. At the end of each action by an ally, gain 4 Velocity stacks (if Mayumi's Speed is over 100, gain 1 more Velocity stack for every 10 points of Speed over 100; up to 6 stacks).\\nAt the start of Mayumi's turn, if Velocity is over 120 stacks, can spend Velocity to gain an extra action at the end of her current action (cooldown: 1 turn). When total Velocity stacks gained during battle reach 100/220/350 stacks, activate level 1/2/3 of Torque Boost.\\nTorque Boost: Increase party's pierce rate by 5%/10%/15%.": "",
  "At the end of each action by an ally, gain 10 more Velocity stacks.\\nOn an extra action, when using a skill different from the one used immediately before, activate the following additional effects.\\nShockwave: When activating a skill, increase critical damage by 50%.\\nAero Setup: Increase shield by 30%. Also, increase party's Defense by 30% more.\\nPoder Setup: Increase main target's pierce rate by 10% more.": "",
  "When activating Torque Boost, activate the following additional effects.\\nLevel 1: Increase party's critical damage by 20%.\\nLevel 2: Increase party's damage by 20%.\\nLevel 3: Increase party's Attack by 30%.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Poder Setup and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase party's damage by 10% more. Also, extend the duration of the Highlight's buffs by 1 turn.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Shockwave and Aero Setup by 3.": "",
  "The amount of Velocity stacks gained at the start of battle becomes 120. On Mayumi's extra action, spend 40 or 80 Velocity stacks, and activate the following additional effects the next time a skill is activated.\\n40 Velocity spent\\nShockwave: When activating a skill, increase Mayumi's critical rate by 20%. If the target is knocked down, increase party's Attack by 25% for 2 turns.\\nAero Setup: Increase shield by 20%. Also, extend the shield duration by 1 turn.\\nPoder Setup: When used on an extra turn, change buff target from main target to all allies.\\n80 Velocity spent\\nShockwave: Increase party's damage dealt to downed foes by 15% for 1 turn.\\nAero Setup: Decrease party's damage taken by 20% for 1 turn.\\nPoder Setup: Increase party's damage dealt by 25% for 1 turn.": "",
  "r:\"^Phys dmg to all foes \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\.\\s*Also, increase party's dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ bonus ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\).\\s*When used on extra action, increase skill dmg (\\d+)%, and guaranteed crit hit on main target\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's Atk ([\\d.]+)% \\+ bonus ([\\d.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\. Also increase party's Def ([\\d.]+)% \\+ bonus ([\\d.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nWhen used on extra action, grant shield to all allies \\((\\d+), (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's pierce rate ([\\d.]+)% \\+ bonus ([\\d.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\. Also, increase party's Atk ([\\d.]+)% \\+ bonus ([\\d.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nWhen used on extra action, also increase main target's pierce rate ([\\d.]+)% \\+ bonus ([\\d.]+)% per (\\d+) Speed \\(max bonus ([\\d.]+)%, (\\d+) turn\\)\\.\"": "",
